# Ignore transient logs/evidence by default, but keep cross-session coordination files.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!bootstrap-report.md
!stages/
!stages/*.md
!actions/
!actions/*.json
!handoffs/
!handoffs/*.md
!platform-sync/
!platform-sync/README.md
!platform-sync/TEMPLATE.md
!platform-sync/a0/
!platform-sync/a0/*.md
!platform-sync/windows/
!platform-sync/windows/*.md
!platform-sync/macos/
!platform-sync/macos/*.md
